{"id": "unknown-2026-06-04-015", "date": "2026-06-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cathode_material", "industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Waymo’s retired robotaxi batteries are heading back to work", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/06/Donte-and-Freeman-inspecting-a-B24-in-Lancaster.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"h-\">Waymo’s retired EV batteries won’t be heading straight to recycling anymore. Instead, they’re going to help support the power grid in California and Texas.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"battery-recycling,battery-storage,electric-vehicles,evs", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/06/04/waymo-retired-robotaxi-batteries-are-heading-back-to-work-b2u/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-04-016", "date": "2026-06-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "ELM MicroGrid installs battery storage in its hometown [video]", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/06/ELM_PEORIA.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Battery energy storage specialist ELM MicroGrid has spent more than two decades building a nationwide energy storage and utility infrastructure businesses. Now, the company is bringing that expertise home with the installation of a new battery energy storage system at a solar microgrid project in Peoria, IL.</p>\n\n\n\n <", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/06/03/elm-microgrid-installs-battery-storage-in-its-hometown-video/", "type": "rss"}]}
